data: {"id": "7b9028baee3648d5-thinking-parallel_evidence-1426", "run_id": "7b9028baee3648d5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已有足够的证据来判断该 Pod 的 NotReady 状态及其直接原因。让我整理已采集的关键事实：\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Pod 状态（kubectl_get_yaml + kubectl_get_by_name）\n- **phase**: Running，但 **Ready = False**，READY = 0/1\n- **容器状态**: app 容器 `ready=False, restarts=0`\n- **节点**: node2，IP 172.16.104.26\n- **无崩溃重启**: restarts=0，说明容器未发生过 crash/restart\n\n### 2. 事件（kubectl_events）—— 直接根因证据\n- **Readiness probe 失败**，两种模式交替出现：\n  1. `connection refused` (tcp 172.16.104.26:8080 连接被拒绝) —— 端口未监听\n  2. `HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` —— 端口可连但应用返回 503\n\n### 3", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788458308196, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

